<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-05T02:38:37.213Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 02:38:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue their month-long siege of Taiz, deepening the humanitarian crisis for trapped civilians. Yemeni government forces have taken control of the strategic al-Jawf mountain range, expanding their territorial gains. The Yemeni government accuses Iran’s IRGC and Hezbollah of sending 21 experts to support the Houthis, indicating increased external involvement. India reports that one of its citizens died from wounds sustained in a Houthi attack on Riyadh airport. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168723&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMXVfVkFlUGYya1F1S09GMzdSMnNkaE9nbmkySGFtSkNHcklPRHdQblA5aEN1WDQ5QnVWb2czb3FocHNRalIwWXEzYl9NTzRJYTFUWGQ1NGpIR09EdkllVGd5QmpmZ21pd2dWRVpEczhvT3ZQUGpPaE1vdUpzN29kdzVTVWh1Uld6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNa3ZpaFZyeTU4OFM3RXhFQWdXcXhPODFkSHZJdnRkcm9EeFMwb0tRY2hZdDVVaEY3R0RVdGs2RjVKYWh5UHlKSVY0d0xEaENYVDBvamxBU3RzTm1NbmhnYWVBV0VNLUhNUG91blBuOFVKUzVtdE9Dc3hnVXoxdlFJcVFXTVVhVjNfQzVaVFpiT0tIckxjVXRQOGN3RE81SWZJOUhkU0MzTmRaMlUtbHd3cW9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&